      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this beautifully presented three-bedroom, one-bathroom mid-terraced family home to the market, ideally positioned on the peaceful and highly sought-after Tamarisk Avenue, Kilnamanagh, Dublin 24. The property enjoys an excellent family-friendly setting, with a wide range of local amenities right on its doorstep, including schools, shops, parks and excellent transport links. Offering a superb combination of space, location and convenience, this home represents a fantastic opportunity for first-time buyers, growing families and investors alike.\nBright, airy and spacious, this superb three-bedroom home offers approximately 103 sq. m. of well-proportioned living accommodation and is presented in excellent condition throughout, providing a warm and inviting family home. The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a cosy living room with feature fireplace, and a fully fitted kitchen with ample storage and a generous dining area. To the rear, just off the kitchen, is a light-filled conservatory overlooking the garden, providing an ideal additional living space. Upstairs, there are three spacious bedrooms with built-in wardrobes, along with a fully tiled family bathroom. To the rear is a sunny, private and enclosed low-maintenance garden complete with storage shed, while the front of the property benefits from ample off-street parking on an attractive driveway. Additional features include gas-fired central heating, no onward chain, generous room proportions, excellent storage throughout and heaps of potential. This wonderful property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers and growing families alike who are looking to put down roots in a fantastic, well-established area.\nContact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 086 8225318 or 01 908 9300 to arrange a viewing and see all that this family home has to offer.\n\nFeatures;\n- c.103 sq.m\n- 3 Bed/ 1 Bath Mid Terrace\n-Light filled kitchen conservatory\n-Spacious room proportions\n-Gas fired central heating\n-BER E\n-Ample storage\n-Family friendly location\n-Prime for first time buyers & growing families\n-No onward chain\n-Bus routes & schools on your doorstep\n-Within arm's reach of M50 & N7 motorway\n-Early viewing strongly advised!\n\nDirections: Eircode is D24 XTX3"
      },
      {
